# Edge Function secrets. Copy to supabase/.secrets.prod (gitignored), fill in,
# then: cd supabase && supabase secrets set --env-file .secrets.prod
#
# Do NOT add SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY here: hosted Edge
# Functions get them injected automatically, and `supabase secrets set`
# rejects names starting with SUPABASE_.

# notify_discord -- one webhook per Discord channel, looked up generically as
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_<CODE>. Codes: 2-letter US state (DISCORD_WEBHOOK_CA, ...),
# plus combined/non-US channels:
#   DISCORD_WEBHOOK_MD_DC        #maryland-and-dc  (routes both MD and DC)
#   DISCORD_WEBHOOK_CAN_ONTARIO  #can-ontario
#   DISCORD_WEBHOOK_NEW_ZEALAND  #new-zealand
# Unmatched or not-yet-wired regions fall back to DISCORD_WEBHOOK_DEFAULT,
# which should be the #uncharted-waters channel webhook. Wiring is incremental:
# any channel without a secret simply falls to the default.
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_DEFAULT=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...
DISCORD_USERNAME=ASP Notifier
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_CA=
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_TX=
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_MD_DC=
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_CAN_ONTARIO=
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_NEW_ZEALAND=

# purge_deleted (shared secret checked by the scheduled purge endpoint)
PURGE_CRON_SECRET=change-me
